          "full_form": "anti-money laundering",
          "zh": [
            "反洗钱"
          ],
          "en_quote": "Understanding the features of trade finance that might be abused and recognizing the associated risks is important for financial institutions, regulatory bodies, and businesses involved in trade. By implementing robust AML/CFT measures and remaining vigilant, stakeholders can mitigate these risks and ensure the integrity of trade finance transactions."
        }
